    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squirrel and Sea is a an underwater 2.5D, mouse only, difficult game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world with each stroke of your paddle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine how you would use a paddle while kayaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your friend jellyfish, fish, seals and other animals underwater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime is estimated to between 8 to\u00a0\u221e hours</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free bubble skins for winners who survive to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May lose your progress over and over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's story will become clear upon completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two different endings by the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never give up!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
